cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying data record, please cite both the article and the release."
title: "CausalVisionRI: causal-prior-constrained deep learning for 24-h rapid-intensification warning in the western North Pacific"
abstract: >-
  Source code and derived data record for a 24-h rapid-intensification (RI)
  warning system for western North Pacific tropical cyclones. The system fuses
  satellite infrared imagery, ERA5 environmental fields and a causal graph
  discovered from the observations (masked PCMCI+ on the 2000-2017 fit split),
  and constrains training with the discovered structure and eight
  sign-verified causal effects. Evaluation follows a frozen, leakage-protected
  holdout (fit 2000-2017 / inner 2018-2019 / test 2020-2024, 3,004 test rows)
  with a re-issuable protocol lock and an append-only test receipt.
